ark","subtitle":"Campus recreation destination, 936 N. 19th St.","notes":"Use this as a daylight reset between indoor stops. Check what spaces are active, meet up with friends, or simply mark the park as part of your campus map.","short_summary":"An outdoor recreation destination included in student access.","evidence_claim":"Marquette lists Norris Park at 936 N. 19th Street among facilities available through an enrolled student’s recreation membership.","source_url":"https://www.marquette.edu/campus-rec/memberships.php","source_title":"Campus Recreation Memberships | Marquette University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"For current enrolled students, campus recreation access is included in segregated fees; verify facility availability before planning an activity.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"marquette-varsity-theatre","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Varsity Theatre","title":"See what is happening at Varsity","subtitle":"Holthusen Hall, 1324 W. Wisconsin Ave.","notes":"Walk by the theatre and check the current calendar for a public lecture, concert, film, or campus program. Choose an event only after confirming its entry details.","short_summary":"A campus theatre used for performances, films and lectures.","evidence_claim":"Marquette states that the renovated Varsity Theatre serves as a lecture hall, concert venue and cinema.","source_url":"https://www.marquette.edu/campus-map/location.php?id=Varsity+Theatre","source_title":"Varsity Theatre | Marquette University Campus Map","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The campus-map page identifies wheelchair-accessible doors with a button at the building’s south entrance; event admission varies.","cost_status":"unknown","under2